            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="1031" n="1002" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76v18/pg1002"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following changes have been made to the online version of <ref
                        target="frus:frus1969-76v18">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1969–1976, Volume XVIII,
                        China, 1973–1976</ref>. Please be aware that printed volumes have not been
                    revised. Revised information is in italic.</p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. Footnote 3, Document 13. Page 148.</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The revised footnote reads: “3. <hi rendition="#italic">Hafiz Ismail was
                            Adviser to President Sadat for National Security Affairs</hi>.”</item>
                    <item>Footnote 3 originally read: “3. Ismail Fahmi was the Egyptian Minister for
                        Foreign Affairs from 1973 until 1977.”</item>
                    <lb/>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">2. Index. Page 948.</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>Ismail Fahmi has been deleted from the Index.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
